Package: hercrusdic
Title: Use Infinite Campus Data from Racine Unified School District
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ben", "Taft", , "ben.taft@career2cradle.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Higher Expectations for Racine County", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Since 2014-15, Racine Unified has used Infinite Campus as its
  student information system. This package provides an R interface to the kinds
  of csv files that one can download from Infinite Campus's web interface. 
